      "eyebrow": "The frame",
      "heading": "Six sections every report shares",
      "html": "<p>The content changes with the job. The frame does not.</p><p><strong>Who and where.</strong> Site or asset address, client and contact, your name and qualification, a report reference, date and time.</p><p><strong>Scope.</strong> What you covered and what you did not. If you could not reach a roof void, say so. A report silent on its limits claims it saw everything.</p><p><strong>Method.</strong> Looking only, or testing too? Which instruments? Did you read old records? Short for routine jobs. Vital for complex ones.</p>"
