      "html": "<p><strong>Findings</strong> are the body. For each item: the place, a rating, what you saw, and a photo where it matters.</p><p><strong>Actions</strong> turn what you saw into a plan. A numbered list. Each says what to do, who owns it, the priority (urgent, required or monitor) and the date. Without these, the client has a list of problems and no plan.</p><p><strong>Sign-off</strong> is your signature and the date. For certificated work, add the statement the standard asks for.</p>"
